Then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}f(x)=\\int {f}^{′}(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (\\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}-3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x-\\int 3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x-3\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\text{ arcsec }x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534467 true] [17592186289875 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289876 13194139534467 true] [17592186289875 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289877 13194139534467 true] [17592186289875 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289878 13194139534467 true] [17592186289875 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289879 13194139534467 true] [17592186289875 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289880 13194139534467 true] [17592186289875 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534467 true] [17592186289875 1041 "selection" 13194139534467 true] [17592186289875 1104 #edb/ref 17592186289879 13194139534467 true] [17592186289875 1110 #uuid "0d6bb721-2892-5339-bbf4-d67f54c4260d" 13194139534467 true] [17592186289876 1034 "2\\text{ arcsec }x-3\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C" 13194139534467 true] [17592186289876 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534467 true] [17592186289876 1111 #uuid "36d1d6bd-52b8-55d8-b03e-603c62e4dd70" 13194139534467 true] [17592186289877 1034 "3\\operatorname{sec}⁡x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C" 13194139534467 true] [17592186289877 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534467 true] [17592186289877 1111 #uuid "a36bc411-16a6-559b-b68f-392981353186" 13194139534467 true] [17592186289878 1034 "6\\text{ arcsec }x-\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C" 13194139534467 true] [17592186289878 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534467 true] [17592186289878 1111 #uuid "41d08bf7-3d83-54d6-bb7a-caaaadce57b7" 13194139534467 true] [17592186289879 1034 "2\\text{ arcsec }x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C" 13194139534467 true] [17592186289879 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534467 true] [17592186289879 1111 #uuid "cad086a5-ec67-5a9e-86c1-def8999bece3" 13194139534467 true] [17592186289880 1034 "2\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C" 13194139534467 true] [17592186289880 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534467 true] [17592186289880 1111 #uuid "4c30a391-1d57-5df2-a726-453dfa5f969e" 13194139534467 true] [17592186289881 1017 #edb/ref 17592186289882 13194139534467 true] [17592186289881 1089 "q-49150" 13194139534467 true] [17592186289881 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534467 true] [17592186289881 1100 "$\\int \\frac{{x}^{2}-7}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139534467 true] [17592186289881 1113 #uuid "f5e46f0c-2f7a-5a5a-b5e7-c87523ec7296" 13194139534467 true] [17592186289881 1145 "This integral doesn't look like one of the basic ones. However, we can manipulate the numerator a bit  to make it look more like the denominator, which reveals a more familiar expression: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x)=\\frac{{x}^{2}-7}{{x}^{2}+1} & =\\frac{{x}^{2}+1-1-7}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{({x}^{2}+1)-8}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{{x}^{2}+1}}{\\cancel{{x}^{2}+1}}-\\frac{8}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =1-\\frac{8}{{x}^{2}+1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRemembering that\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C,\n$$\n\nwe can now calculate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x)=\\int {f}^{′}(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (1-\\frac{8}{{x}^{2}+1})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\text{d}x-\\int \\frac{8}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\text{d}x-8\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x-8\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534467 true] [17592186289882 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289883 13194139534467 true] [17592186289882 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289884 13194139534467 true] [17592186289882 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289885 13194139534467 true] [17592186289882 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289886 13194139534467 true] [17592186289882 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289887 13194139534467 true] [17592186289882 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534467 true] [175921